WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.352
One night Rabbit fell asleep and started to dream.

2
00:00:14.353 --> 00:00:17.798
Sparkling dust filled the air.

3
00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:23.888
"This must be fairy dust!" he thought.

4
00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:29.930
Horse often told Rabbit stories about fairies.

5
00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:33.245
Rabbit looked down.

6
00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:37.172
He had legs and feet.

7
00:00:37.173 --> 00:00:45.069
He jumped out the playroom window.

8
00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:57.072
Beautiful white flowers danced in the grass.

9
00:00:57.073 --> 00:01:03.153
Rabbit floated up to the clouds.

10
00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:07.630
He hopped as high as he could.

11
00:01:07.631 --> 00:01:22.068
He hopped to one star and another.

12
00:01:22.069 --> 00:01:40.778
Then he hopped all the way to the moon.

13
00:01:40.779 --> 00:01:43.520
Rabbit was smiling when he woke up.

14
00:01:43.521 --> 00:01:47.070
"What a cool dream!" he thought.

15
00:01:47.071 --> 00:01:49.479
"I have to tell someone!"

16
00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:54.417
Rabbit looked around.

17
00:01:54.418 --> 00:01:58.945
Only one other toy was awake—Robot.

18
00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:01.663
"Robot!" Rabbit whispered.

19
00:02:01.664 --> 00:02:06.050
"I had an amazing dream!"

20
00:02:06.051 --> 00:02:10.403
"So?" Robot said.

21
00:02:10.404 --> 00:02:14.438
"I had legs and feet," Rabbit said.

22
00:02:14.439 --> 00:02:18.127
"I hopped to the stars and the moon!"

23
00:02:18.128 --> 00:02:23.311
Robot clicked. "That's ridiculous!"

24
00:02:23.312 --> 00:02:25.586
Rabbit's whiskers twitched.

25
00:02:25.587 --> 00:02:30.473
"Robot, can't you try to be nice?

26
00:02:30.474 --> 00:02:33.820
Henry is nice to all of us.

27
00:02:33.821 --> 00:02:37.558
And I'm nice to everyone too."

28
00:02:37.559 --> 00:02:39.838
Robot's lights flashed.

29
00:02:39.839 --> 00:02:43.563
"Fine. Sorry," Robot said.

30
00:02:43.564 --> 00:02:47.558
"We know Henry loves you the most.

31
00:02:47.559 --> 00:02:54.217
Not all of us can be soft and cuddly."

32
00:02:54.218 --> 00:02:57.685
Rabbit blinked as Robot spun away.

33
00:02:57.686 --> 00:03:01.276
"Robot sounded sad," Rabbit thought.

34
00:03:01.277 --> 00:03:09.352
"Maybe he wants Henry to hold and hug him too."

